        <h1>Breakdown Recovery on the M42</h1>
        <p class="page-hero__lede">The M42 loops around the south and east of Birmingham, linking the M40 and M5 near Bromsgrove around through Solihull, the NEC and Birmingham Airport, and on to the M6 at Coleshill. If you've broken down on this bypass, we can recover you.</p>
