            <summary>Does the M42 go past the NEC and Birmingham Airport?<span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></summary>
            <p>Yes — Junction 6 of the M42 serves the NEC, Birmingham Airport and Solihull directly, and traffic here can build quickly around major shows and events. If you're not sure which junction you're near, a terminal name or event venue is a useful landmark to give us.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Are there fewer places to pull over on the M42 than on other roads into Birmingham?<span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></summary>
